Iterables**: Type support for async iteration over paged API results.\n* **Signature Verification**: Interfaces and types for verifying HTTP request signatures.\n\nThis library is used by JavaScript SDKs generated by the [APIMatic Code Generator](http://www.apimatic.io). For details on supported platforms and build artifacts, see the [Build and Usage Section](https://github.com/apimatic/apimatic-js-runtime?tab=readme-ov-file#builds-and-usage).","readmeFilename":"README.md"}